{"id":"n27342-1-7","stage":3,"title":"거스름돈 · 找头","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27342-1-7-1","ko":"거스름돈을 잘못 주신 것 같은데요.","zh":"我觉得您给的找零好像有误。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"거스름돈을","meaning":"找头，零钱","explanation":"거스름돈：找头，零钱；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"거스름돈","audio":"/audio/9a7edba3434d44c421dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27342","senseId":"1","lemma":"거스름돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘못","meaning":"错","explanation":"잘못：错","readings":[{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62478","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주신","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은데요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9a7edba3434d44c4","term":"거스름돈","zh":"找头，零钱","audio":"/audio/9a7edba3434d44c421dc.mp3","entryId":"27342","definition":"去掉该支付的钱后返还的或重新收到的钱。","pronunciation":["거스름똔"]},{"id":"cd1c34de004dbb0d","term":"잘못","zh":"错","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3","entryId":"62478","definition":"不正或错误地。","pronunciation":["잘몯"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1f12d6fbae097840cb22.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27342-1-7-2","ko":"죄송합니다, 손님. 다시 계산해 드리겠습니다.","zh":"非常抱歉，顾客。我重新为您计算一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송합니다,","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손님.","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다시","meaning":"再，重新","explanation":"다시：再，重新","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"2","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계산해","meaning":"结账，买单","explanation":"계산하다：结账，买单；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"계산하다","audio":"/audio/789e5000e94e13298d23.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62498","senseId":"2","lemma":"계산하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드리겠습니다.","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"920b0d402f08f1fb","term":"다시","zh":"再，重新","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3","entryId":"62539","definition":"变换方法或目标等而重做。","pronunciation":["다시"]},{"id":"789e5000e94e1329","term":"계산하다","zh":"结账，买单","audio":"/audio/789e5000e94e13298d23.mp3","entryId":"62498","definition":"支付东西的价钱或费用。","pronunciation":["계ː산하다","게ː산하다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9af0052c4a97d6138a74.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27342","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":106,"sequenceScore":2.7667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我觉得您给的找零好像有误。","非常抱歉，顾客。我重新为您计算一下。","听说你办了定期储蓄对吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我觉得您给的找零好像有误。","非常抱歉，顾客。我重新为您计算一下。","听说你办了定期储蓄对吧？"],"answer":1}]}
